WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.816
Learn's own pages disagree in four places,

2
00:00:02.816 --> 00:00:05.988
recorded so a later edit
doesn't loosen the code.

3
00:00:05.988 --> 00:00:10.187
The pass's lifetime argument has two
names, and the lint reads either.

4
00:00:10.187 --> 00:00:13.175
The custom task extension has two I Ds.

5
00:00:13.175 --> 00:00:17.575
The mover category appears in an
example but not in the property table.

6
00:00:17.575 --> 00:00:20.251
And the workflow ceiling
is a hundred on two

7
00:00:20.251 --> 00:00:23.225
pages and fifty on another,
so the budget is fifty.

8
00:00:23.225 --> 00:00:27.158
Still open: the trigger name
for an extension attribute,

9
00:00:27.158 --> 00:00:32.860
the execution limit the API doesn't carry,
and the pass's availability in GCC High.
